# NOTE: The SSL certificate ProxySQL presents to the services for internal database
#       connections must be added to this file, without its private key. Delete
#       this comment afterwards.
#
#       It is needed when ProxySQL and internal TLS are both enabled, which is the
#       default from OpenStack 2025.2 on. To run ProxySQL without TLS instead, set
#       database_enable_tls_internal: "no" in environments/kolla/configuration.yml.
#
# DOCS: https://osism.tech/docs/guides/configuration-guide/loadbalancer#tls-certificates
